// V10 — "The Pelagic Observatory". A layered scientific viewing habitat, not
// a cartoon aquarium: recessed glass, machined ribs, calibration lights,
// ocean-floor structure, living kelp, suspended plankton and anatomically
// informed, moving medusae. Everything stays behind the foreground devices.
const marineNoise=n=>{let q=Math.sin(n*127.1+93.71)*43758.5453;return q-Math.floor(q)};
// Recessed circular observation portal: black-anodized main frame, recessed
